                      "text": "It is currently early Wednesday morning in **Melbourne, Victoria (Australia)** (November 18), and conditions are cool and cloudy.\n\n### **Early Morning Conditions** *(as of ~3:30–3:45 AM AEDT)*\n* **Temperature:** Around **13–14°C (55–57°F)**, feeling closer to **11–12°C (52°F)**.\n* **Sky \u0026 Humidity:** Cloudy, with humidity between **73% and 81%**.\n* **Wind:** Light southerly to south-southeasterly winds around **7–11 km/h (4–7 mph)**.\n\n### **Wednesday's Forecast**\n* **Temperature:** A low of **11°C (52°F)** warming to a high of **21°C (70°F)**.\n* **Conditions:** Partly cloudy throughout the day, with a chance of early morning fog in the northeastern suburbs. Rain is very unlikely (**5% chance**).\n* **Wind:** Light winds picking up to southerly **15–20 km/h (9–12 mph)** in the late afternoon before easing again late in the evening.",
